EdgeVision references the Rockchip rknn_model_zoo v1.6.0 implementation for
RKNN API usage, YOLOv5 anchors, strides, output interpretation, decode rules,
letterbox behavior, NMS semantics, and bbox restoration.

The referenced Rockchip source files carry their own Apache License 2.0
notices. This project does not currently select a root-project LICENSE; the
final licensing decision is deferred to the V1 release audit.
